      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If the group has already been deleted, instead of placeholder \"Owners\" text, the group name will also be blank in this scenario (as with public instances). It should say \"Owners\".\n\n```\n\n2025.12.16 23:36:28 Error      -  [API] [224, 404, Get, -1 https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/groups/grp_6102d838-c02d-44d2-a953-0c2211d025ab?includeRoles=true] Abandoning request, because - Can't find groupǃ\n\n2025.12.16 23:36:31 Error      -  [API] [238, 404, Get, -1 https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/groups/grp_6102d838-c02d-44d2-a953-0c2211d025ab?includeRoles=true] Abandoning request, because - Can't find groupǃ\n\n2025.12.16 23:36:39 Error      -  [API] [251, 404, Get, -1 https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/groups/grp_6102d838-c02d-44d2-a953-0c2211d025ab?includeRoles=true] Abandoning request, because - Can't find groupǃ\n\n```",
