  "details": "1. Join a public instance of a public world (?).\n\n2. Grab a world ID of a private world (e.g. [wrld_67fcaf00-4330-4534-9974-10a0e9b6fc3b](https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_67fcaf00-4330-4534-9974-10a0e9b6fc3b/info)) and create a public instance of a private (link-only) world via invite link to workaround [existing limitations](https://feedback.vrchat.com/website/p/invite-me-api-allows-creating-group-public-instances-of-private-worlds-while-the): https://vrchat.com/home/launch?worldId=wrld_67fcaf00-4330-4534-9974-10a0e9b6fc3b&instanceId=28058~region(eu)\n\n3. Press \"Invite Me\" to send yourself an invite.\n\n4. View Instance of that invite. Notice the \"Rejoin\" button and \"You are here\", and the missing instance owner name (should've been the world author's name).\n\nAside: If you click the \"Rejoin\" button here, you'll load and join the public instance of that private world instead of rejoining your current world.\n\nOutput logs don't have anything of interest for this, but are attached nonetheless.",
